---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="On chain" path="/on-chain" description="Every claim on this site points at something you can check. The Move packages behind the live products, listed with full addresses.">
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="hero-field" data-field></div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div><p class="cmd"><span data-glyph="hash"></span>On-chain records</p><h1>On chain.</h1><p class="lede">Every claim on this site points at something you can check. This page lists the packages behind the live products &mdash; full addresses, no shortcuts.</p></div>
      <figure class="markfig"><div class="markfield" data-mark="hero" data-mark-seq="mark,sui" role="img" aria-label="Blocks building the X, then the word sui."></div></figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section" style="border-top:0;padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="table-wrap" data-reveal><table class="pk"><thead><tr><th>package</th><th>address</th><th class="r">chain state</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody><tr><td class="accent">weir core</td><td class="num"><a class="addr" href="https://suivision.xyz/package/0xdc6dbb96885ba049c5d860d0b775b9e968cf9053a227861ae006f22e352884b5">0xdc6dbb96885ba049c5d860d0b775b9e968cf9053a227861ae006f22e352884b5</a></td><td class="r num">v5 &middot; account, creator, entitlement, key_registry, platform, stake</td></tr><tr><td class="accent">weir core (original)</td><td class="num"><a class="addr" href="https://suivision.xyz/package/0xc5c833991ed1123d70b1001c0bcdb01ec5728b09f25dfc42a0edaf16005d404d">0xc5c833991ed1123d70b1001c0bcdb01ec5728b09f25dfc42a0edaf16005d404d</a></td><td class="r num">v5 lineage root &middot; also the Seal namespace package</td></tr><tr><td class="accent">weir payments (USDC)</td><td class="num"><a class="addr" href="https://suivision.xyz/package/0xdba34672e30cb065b1f93e3ab55318768fd6fef66c15942c9f7cb846e2f900e7">0xdba34672e30cb065b1f93e3ab55318768fd6fef66c15942c9f7cb846e2f900e7</a></td><td class="r num">v1 &middot; usdc</td></tr><tr><td class="accent">weir key server</td><td class="num"><a class="addr" href="https://suivision.xyz/package/0x9636e0c761e7476b8579cb13d543838e3732ca482dc0a64f086f57b60c024e23">0x9636e0c761e7476b8579cb13d543838e3732ca482dc0a64f086f57b60c024e23</a></td><td class="r num">v5 &middot; key_server, hmac, kdf, gf256</td></tr><tr><td class="accent">projectx_raffle</td><td class="num"><a class="addr" href="https://suivision.xyz/package/0xb475146208b53d16c3498c9757d623386c17fc197df544386ed496a74e79f8ee">0xb475146208b53d16c3498c9757d623386c17fc197df544386ed496a74e79f8ee</a></td><td class="r num">v6 &middot; fenwick, raffle_v1</td></tr><tr><td class="accent">northlatch_soul</td><td class="num"><a class="addr" href="https://suivision.xyz/package/0x8d6567ed7bf34d99eefefe745c3a282fd89a12fdcd77e6bd10b19b35b599635f">0x8d6567ed7bf34d99eefefe745c3a282fd89a12fdcd77e6bd10b19b35b599635f</a></td><td class="r num">v1 &middot; soul</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
    <p class="small faint" style="margin-top:16px" data-reveal>Every published package behind the live products, listed with its full address so each row is checkable on its own — weir&#39;s own agent manifest names the latest and original core packages, and every row below resolved on Sui mainnet over GraphQL when this table was last checked (2026-11-25). A row appears only once its address resolves; accounts and vaults are not packages, so they are not table rows.</p>
    <div class="twocol" style="margin-top:48px">
      <div data-reveal><p class="cmd"><span data-glyph="terminal"></span>Reproduce anything</p>
        <p class="muted" style="margin-top:8px">Clone the verify repository and run the same gate suite our CI runs &mdash; on your machine, against your checkout.</p>
        <div class="term"><div class="term-body" style="min-height:0"><div class="c">git clone https://github.com/Northlatch-Labs-LLC/protocolx-verify.git</div><div class="c">cd protocolx-verify</div><div class="c">bash scripts/run-self-gates.sh</div><div class="out">&gt; the same 25 steps CI runs, on your machine <span class="pass">[ ok ]</span></div><div class="out">&gt; a step that cannot run locally is named and skipped, never folded into a pass</div><div class="out">&gt; digest matches.       exit 0</div></div></div></div>
      <div data-reveal><p class="cmd"><span data-glyph="eye"></span>What is public</p><ul class="gets"><li>Source of the verify action and its engine.</li><li>Gate configurations.</li><li>Test corpus for the tests gate.</li><li>Release digests since v0.1, in git history.</li></ul></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</Layout>
